{"title":"무도독존","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=uDJFO/hAdNSs2DZH/YIv085iKkiwkpohx3Rhz21&filename=th3","synopsis":"“내 운명은 내가 개척하겠다!” \n\n가문에서 버려진 주인공은 부모님의 복수를 하고자 끊임없이 강해지고자 노력한다. \n그러던 어느 날 우연히 만난 노인으로부터 신령보의(神靈寶衣)를 얻고, 축기신단(築基神丹)을 복용하게 되며, 통천경도(通天經圖)를 수련할 수 있는 기회를 얻게 된다. 그리고 굳센 의지와 함께 아무도 막을 수 없는 그의 무도 수련의 길이 시작된다. 불후황조(不朽皇朝), 만고대교(萬古大敎), 기괴한 요괴와 마신(魔神)들까지 그의 앞을 가로막는다지만 그는 절대 두려워하지 않는다.\n\n“반드시 강해지겠어!”","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":207,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":209,"change":{"type":"down","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":188,"change":{"type":"up","amount":21}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":139,"change":{"type":"up","amount":49}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":170,"change":{"type":"down","amount":31}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":100,"change":{"type":"up","amount":70}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":218,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":227,"change":{"type":"down","amount":9}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":251,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":120,"change":{"type":"up","amount":131}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":111,"change":{"type":"up","amount":9}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":114,"change":{"type":"down","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":175,"change":{"type":"down","amount":61}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":264,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":183,"change":{"type":"up","amount":81}},{"date":"2026-09-04","rank":262,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-05","rank":245,"change":{"type":"up","amount":17}},{"date":"2026-09-09","rank":286,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-11","rank":257,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-12","rank":211,"change":{"type":"up","amount":47}},{"date":"2026-09-13","rank":294,"change":{"type":"down","amount":83}},{"date":"2026-09-14","rank":227,"change